WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:09.380
Karanja, in Maharashtra — the Kashi of the Jain community.

2
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.120
The Mahavir Digambar Jain Gurukul, founded by Acharya Samantabhadra.

3
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:23.950
Here, the restoration of ancient Jain literature —

4
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:31.160
its recopying, recording and ordering —

5
00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:36.970
is being done by the Shri Shanti Sagar Foundation, Bangalore.

6
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:43.890
Our secretary, […] ji, son of Dhanyakumar ji,

7
00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.080
showed us all of the restoration work.

8
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.830
Seeing it brought great joy.

9
00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:59.760
And to the Jain community across India,

10
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.250
and to all who keep ancient granthas, I say:

11
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.250
have this kind of restoration done too,

12
00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:12.310
so that the granthas come back to life for hundreds of years

13
00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.340
and our dharma and culture are preserved.

14
00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:22.980
For this, my many, many blessings to the whole community and to the Foundation.
